## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen3-8-Max (API id `qwen3.8-max`)
- **Short description:** Alibaba's largest Qwen3.8-series commercial API model (released mid-2026): 1M-token context, near-frontier coding/agentic scores at aggressive regional pricing; sits above Qwen3-Max and below open-weight Qwen3-Coder/MoE siblings on openness.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio / DashScope `qwen3.8-max` (OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions); international vs mainland-CN pricing tiers; also via OpenRouter/aggregators under Qwen3-8-Max aliases. Not self-hosted (closed API).
- **Release / knowledge:** Qwen3.8 generation 2026; exact GA date not isolated in sources read (Model Studio docs current as of 2026-09). Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.8-max` (DashScope); `qwen3-8-max` on gateways.
- **Context window:** **1,000,000 tokens** input (Model Studio: 991,808 max input tokens on some plans); max output not isolated — DashScope default 8K–16K typical, raise via `max_tokens`.
- **Modalities:** text + image in (Qwen-VL lineage — multimodal chat supported); text out; thinking mode toggle; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-22):** region-dependent — cited bands **$1.65 in / $4.95–6.00 out** (intl promo/standard low end) up to **$2.00 in / $6.00 out** per 1M on standard intl tier; CN-mainland tier separate (CNY). Cache-hit input discounted (~50%+ on Model Studio). Paid API — not free.
- **Architecture:** proprietary dense/MoE hybrid (undisclosed params); flagship "Max" tier of Qwen3.8 line.

